# Amar Food Map - Environment Variables Template
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Currently, the application is 100% self-contained and operates entirely
# client-side using localStorage persistence and static GeoJSON mapping.
# NO environment variables are strictly required for production deployment on Vercel.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# [Optional] Canonical public production URL (e.g. for OpenGraph and social sharing)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://amar-food-map.vercel.app

# [Optional / Future Architecture] Supabase integration (when migrating from localStorage to cloud auth & sync)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
